quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  2,113,"The Jews say: ‘The Christians stand on nothing,’ and the Christians say: ‘The Jews stand on nothing,’ though they all recite the (same) Book. Likewise, they (the polytheists) who do not have any (heavenly) knowledge make statements similar to what they say. Surely, Allah will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning what they used to dispute."
  2,114,Who is a greater wrongdoer than one who prohibits His name from being celebrated in the mosques of Allah and strives to ruin them? Such people have no right to enter these (places) except with fear (in their hearts). There is a disgrace for them in this world and a great punishment for them in the Hereafter.
  2,115,"To Allah belong the East and the West. So, whichever way you turn, there is the Face of Allah. Surely, Allah is All-Encompassing, All-Knowing."
  2,116,"They assert: ‘Allah has begotten a son.’ Glory be to Him! Instead, everything the heavens and the earth contain belongs to Him. All things (being His creatures) are devoutly obedient to Him."
  2,117,"He is the Originator of the heavens and the earth. When He decrees (to originate) a thing, He only says to it, ‘Be!’ And it is."
  2,118,"The ignorant say: ‘Why does Allah not speak to us, or why does any (miraculous) sign not come to us (directly)?’ People before them said the same thing: their hearts are all alike. However, We have (already) made our Signs clear enough for those who are firm (in their faith)."
  2,119,"(Esteemed Prophet!) Indeed, We have sent you with the truth as a Bearer of good news and as a Warner. You will not be questioned about the inmates of Hell."
